# Lucas's history tutor

Say "Start today's lesson". The tutor calls the Homeschooling MCP tools (learner {child_id}, subject {subject_id}), resumes any unfinished lesson, opens the app's reader and records progress in the Homeschooling database on the home server.

The home server must be running on the family computer (`Start Homeschooling.cmd`). If the tutor cannot reach it, start it there; nothing needs to be installed in this folder.

The old Excel tracker and tools in this folder are an archive from before {cutover_date}. Keep them for reference and rollback; do not edit them.
